-- dt-plus-mixed-001 (dt-plus-mixed, difficulty 3)
select pg_temp.upsert_question($q$dt-plus-mixed-001$q$, $q$prog-1-digi$q$, $q$data-types$q$, 3,
  $q$```csharp
string vysledok = 8 + 6 + "A";
```
Akú hodnotu bude mať premenná `vysledok`?$q$,
  array[$q$`"8"`$q$, $q$`"A68"`$q$, $q$`"14A"`$q$, $q$`"86A"`$q$], 2, $q$Operátor `+` sa vyhodnocuje zľava doprava. Kým sú oba operandy čísla, sčítava; keď je jeden z nich reťazec, spája text. Najprv `8 + 6 = 14`, potom `14 + "A" = "14A"`.$q$,
  $q$```csharp
string vysledok = 8 + 6 + "A";
```
What value will the variable `vysledok` have?$q$,
  array[$q$`"8"`$q$, $q$`"A68"`$q$, $q$`"14A"`$q$, $q$`"86A"`$q$], $q$The `+` operator is evaluated left to right. While both operands are numbers it adds them; once one of them is a string it joins text. First `8 + 6 = 14`, then `14 + "A" = "14A"`.$q$);

